1. Description

    Implemented a comprehensive medicine search and filtering system for the Pharma Store to help customers quickly find medicines and healthcare products from the product catalog.

    The functionality allows users to search products using medicine names or relevant keywords and narrow down results using category, price, availability, and other applicable product attributes.

    The implementation is designed to work seamlessly with the existing medicine product catalog and provide a faster, more convenient shopping experience.

2. Business Requirement

    As the pharmacy product catalog grows, manually browsing every product becomes difficult for customers.

    The Pharma Store therefore required a search and filtering mechanism that allows users to:

    Quickly find a specific medicine.
    Search by medicine/product name.
    Browse products by category.
    Filter products based on price.
    Identify available products.
    Narrow down large product lists.
    Clear filters and return to the complete catalog.

    The functionality also needed to remain responsive and easy to use across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.

3. Features Implemented
   Medicine Search

   Implemented a search interface for finding medicines and healthcare products.

   Users can enter keywords such as:

   Paracetamol
   Metformin
   Vitamin D3
   Cetirizine
   Blood Pressure Monitor

   The system filters the catalog and displays matching products.

4. Search Behavior

    The search functionality supports product discovery based on relevant product information.

    Example:

    User enters:

    "Metformin"

    ↓

    Search

    ↓

    Matching medicine products displayed

    If no matching product is found, an appropriate empty-state message is displayed.

    Example:

    No medicines found matching your search.

5. Category Filtering

    Integrated category-based filtering with the medicine catalog.

    Users can filter products by categories such as:

    Prescription Medicines
    OTC Medicines
    Diabetes Care
    Heart Care
    Skin Care
    Personal Care
    Vitamins & Supplements
    Wellness
    Medical Devices

    Example:

    Category: Diabetes Care

    ↓

    Display only diabetes-related products

6. Price Filtering

    Implemented price-based filtering to help customers find products within their preferred budget.

    Example:

    ₹0 ───────── ₹5,000

    Selected range:

    ₹500 ─────── ₹2,000

    ↓

    Display products between ₹500 and ₹2,000

    This improves product discovery for price-sensitive customers.

7. Availability Filtering

    Added product availability filtering to help customers identify products that can currently be purchased.

    Supported states include:

    In Stock
    Limited Stock
    Out of Stock

    Customers can select the appropriate availability option to narrow the results.

8. Combined Filters

    The system supports applying multiple filters together.

    Example:

    Search:
    Metformin

    Category:
    Diabetes Care

    Price:
    ₹100 – ₹500

    Availability:
    In Stock

    ↓

    Filtered Results

    This provides more precise product discovery.

9. Clear Filters

    Implemented a Clear Filters action that allows users to quickly reset the current filtering conditions.

    Example:

    Category: Diabetes Care
    Price: ₹500–₹1,500
    Availability: In Stock

    [ Clear Filters ]

    ↓

    All Products

    This avoids requiring users to manually remove each filter.

