15. Search and Filter Workflow

     The complete workflow is:

     User opens Shop
          ↓
     Product Catalog displayed
          ↓
     User enters search keyword
          ↓
     Matching products displayed
          ↓
     User selects category/filter
          ↓
     Product results updated
          ↓
     User optionally applies price/availability filter
          ↓
     Filtered products displayed
          ↓
     User selects product
          ↓
     Product Detail Page

16. Empty State Handling

    Implemented a user-friendly empty state when no product matches the selected conditions.

    Example:

     No products found.

     Try changing your search or removing some filters.

     [ Clear Filters ]

     This helps users recover from unsuccessful searches instead of seeing an empty product area.

